error E0090: an anonymous function can't assign an outer var  tests/errors/e0090/main.mo:5:1

  5 | n += 1
    | ^ an anonymous function can't assign an outer var

  --> tests/errors/e0090/main.mo:3:5
  3 | var n = 3
    |     ^ declared here

An anonymous function can read names in scope and assign its own local var, but can't assign a var from an enclosing function (reference 5.6).

